OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and rather damp start  
OL,6,Fto the morning. Slowly becoming drier  
OL,7,Fand brighter, with some sunny spells   
OL,8,Fdeveloping by late morning and into    
OL,9,Fthe early afternoon. Despite this, the 
OL,10,Feasterly breeze will give a rather     
OL,11,Fchilly feel.                           
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying dry, with variable    
OL,14,Fcloud and light winds. A patchy frost  
OL,15,Fmay form where skies remain clear, as  
OL,16,Fwell as a few mist and freezing fog    
OL,17,Fpatches.                               
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
