OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CThursday:FAnother dry and rather       
OL,6,Fcloudy day. The cloud may occasionally 
OL,7,Flift and break to allow a few glimmers 
OL,8,Fof sunshine, mainly in the afternoon.  
OL,9,FFeeling cold with temperatures below   
OL,10,Faverage.                               
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FIt is    
OL,13,Fexpected to turn unsettled through     
OL,14,Fthis period, with rain moving in       
OL,15,Fthrough Friday and Saturday. Cloudy    
OL,16,FSunday, with further rain possible     
OL,17,Flater. Breezy, but turning a little    
OL,18,Fmilder.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
